  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-020-han12:p-nanyue-001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter">初<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-020-han12:m-nanyue-001-0001" ref="bvb_d1z_fd0_*A">南越文王</persName>遣其子<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-020-han12:m-nanyue-001-0008" ref="bvb_d1z_fd0_*AA">嬰齊</persName>入宿衛在長安取邯鄲<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-020-han12:m-nanyue-001-0019" ref="3q4_zsp_jwy">樛氏女</persName>生子<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-020-han12:m-nanyue-001-0024" ref="bvb_d1z_fd0_*AAA">興</persName><persName id="c-zizhitongjian-020-han12:m-nanyue-001-0025" ref="bvb_d1z_fd0_*A">文王</persName>薨<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-020-han12:m-nanyue-001-0028" ref="bvb_d1z_fd0_*AA">嬰齊</persName>立乃蔵其先<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-020-han12:m-nanyue-001-0035" ref="bvb_d1z_fd0">武帝</persName>璽上書請立<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-020-han12:m-nanyue-001-0042" ref="3q4_zsp_jwy">樛氏女</persName>為后<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-020-han12:m-nanyue-001-0047" ref="bvb_d1z_fd0_*AAA">興</persName>為嗣</p>
